**Structured Product Enrollments**:
- INV_2025041801237 (Priya Patel): Valid Aggressive profile, DCI with cooling-off + A/V recording
- INV_2025041801240 (Carlos Martinez): Valid Balanced profile, PPN with cooling-off + A/V recording
