Each transaction exercises different pathways:
- New vs. existing risk profiles
- Various product categories (Mutual Fund, Structured Note, DCI, PPN)
- Different risk profile combinations (Conservative, Balanced, Aggressive)
- Suitability match vs. mismatch scenarios
- Threshold-exceeding vs. standard transactions
- Various channels (Branch, Phone, Mobile, Online)
- With and without cooling-off periods
- With and without A/V recording requirements

All APIs can successfully process each sample data record by following the appropriate conditional logic based on transaction_type, previous_risk_profile validity, product_category, and compliance flags.

